%% Activity — block, report and chat suspension
flowchart TD
  A([User sees an unwanted message]) --> B{Action}
  B -- Block --> C{Target is an admin?}
  C -- Yes --> C1[Not allowed: admins cannot be blocked]
  C -- No --> C2[Blocked user can no longer message them<br/>announcements and notices still arrive]
  B -- Report --> D[/Reason for report/]
  D --> E{Reported person is an admin?}
  E -- Yes --> F[Goes to super admin]
  E -- No --> G[Goes to dept admin of reported person]
  F & G --> H[Admin opens report:<br/>reported message + a few around it only]
  H --> I[View written to audit log]
  I --> J{Decision}
  J -- No action --> K[Report closed]
  J -- Suspend chat --> L[/Set duration and reason/]
  L --> M[User cannot send messages until end time;<br/>rest of the app works; user told; audited]
  J -- Deactivate account --> N[Confirm, account deactivated,<br/>history kept, audited]
  O([Section group]) --> P[CR/DCR may delete any message<br/>or remove a member — cannot delete accounts]
